  "system": {
    "description": "<p>You exert kinetic energy on a target so that it moves more quickly or more slowly.</p><p>Choose a creature within <strong>30 spaces.</strong> Until the start of your next turn, that creature increases its <strong>Speed</strong> by <strong>+5</strong>.</p><p>Alternatively, you can reduce its <strong>Speed</strong> by half.</p><p>You can also target an object to speed it up or slow it down.</p><p>Each extra success extends the duration by <strong>+1 rounds</strong>.</p><p><strong>Effects:</strong> @UUID[Compendium.titan-vttrpg-compendium.effects.ActiveEffect.7tE1OuXQjwsrXikq]{Force Slow}, @UUID[Compendium.titan-vttrpg-compendium.effects.ActiveEffect.oBPUR38FjmAvZaNQ]{Force Speed}</p>",
